<title>USA: New Brighton, Minn., $1.565 mln won by Norwest.</title>
<headline>New Brighton, Minn., $1.565 mln won by Norwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Investment Services said it won $1.565 million of New Brighton, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1997 C, with a true interest cost of 5.14 percent.</p>
</text>
